+// concept.js — CONCEPT ONLY (scratch, never shipped): two worlds the owner is thinking of, drawn far enough to
+// be judged from a still. HELL: plates of basalt afloat on lava, the lava seen DOWN the cracks between them.
+// THE VOID: a pane of glass over deep space — a nebula and a turning galaxy far below, stars at three depths, a
+// star chart's lines on the glass to say where the floor is. Each is one function of the world point, used by the
+// floor (render/floor.js) and by the ground past it (render/scenery.js), so the two meet without a seam.
